<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill rates fall again at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill rates fall again at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills fell further on Wednesday, maintaining a steady rate reduction in the local market, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY  AV YIELD  LAST WEEK  NO OF BANKS  ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day     3.95	4.45	   4	    0.5   0.93   0.5</p>
<p> 91-day     5.19	5.92	   9	    0.5   2.96   0.5</p>
<p> 182-day    5.63	6.13	  13	    1.0   4.44   0.5</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
